    answerType: "expression",
    questionText: "Suppose \\( f(z) \\sim \\sum a_n z^{-n} \\) with \\( a_0 \\neq 0 \\), and let \\( \\{d_n\\} \\) be its reciprocal coefficients (\\( d_0 = 1,\\ \\sum_{k=0}^{n} d_{n-k} a_k = 0 \\)). Show that the leading reciprocal coefficients are \\( d_1 = -a_1/a_0 \\) and \\( d_2 = (a_1^2 - a_0 a_2)/a_0^2 \\).",
